rooms_desc ({"This is Cathy's private bedroom.You can see a lot of flower's and tree's growing in her room, makingyou very relaxed with some nice soft music.On the west wall you see a picture of Cathy in a beautiful dress.There is a large soft bed and a big chair on the east wall.When you spent a few minuts in her room you can almost smell her, wanting you to kiss her and hug her forever!","You have entered Cathy's private bathroom.You can see a big bath and a sink with a big mirror above it.","Ooooh you don't believe your eyes!!!What kind of treasures are lying here???? ","You can see a big stereo installation in a corner.There is also a large couch where you can sit and enjoy the music.","There is a large couch and a little table standing in the middle of this room.You can see a nice TV in the corner and some chairs spread in the room.","Aaaah the garden!!!!You can smell fresh air making you very sober. Ooh you can hear the soundof some birds sitting on the tree's.There are a lot of flowers here growing very happily.In the middle of the garden stands a nice fountain with some chairs to enjoythe lovely view.","You noticed immediately the size of the refrigerator!!!A large, big sink to the north wall and a table with some chairscomplets this kitchen.","You can see some extra beds and tables for some guests staying for the night.","A large closet and some cabinets are on the north wall.In the closet and cabinets cathy keeps her armours and weapons.Some of her collection are very rare and powerfull making you envy her forwhat she's collected.","You can see nothing here!!!! There is absolutely nothing in this room!!It's completely empty!!!!! You wonder why??",})
